{"pin":"AB00728","subcodes":[{"code":"AB00728","anchor":"","first_line":"O befitting servant of the Sacred Threshold! The grievous tidings of the passing of that cherished handmaiden of God reached the divine gathering [3.5s]... ...O Thou Kind Lord! This dearly cherished maidservant was attracted to Thee, and through reflection and discernment longed to attain Thy presence","first_line_orig":"ای بنده زیبنده آستان مقدس خبر وحشت اثر فوت آن کنیز عزیز الهی بانجمن رحمانی  ","language":"Per","word_count":"460","translations":[],"refs":[{"kind":"music","code":"M. Sparrow","source":"M","locator":"Sparrow","url":"https://munirihsparrow.bandcamp.com/track/eternal-rose-garden"},{"kind":"publication","code":"BRL_DAK#1199","source":"BRL_DAK","locator":"1199","url":"https://www.bahai.org/r/474362147"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MJMJ3.111x","source":"MJMJ3","locator":"111x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/MMA3/mma3-113.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MMG2#419 p.465x","source":"MMG2","locator":"419 p.465x","url":"https://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/MMA/mma-468.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"YARP2.434 p.326","source":"YARP2","locator":"434 p.326","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/c/YP/yp-332.html"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BPRY.045-046x","source":"BPRY","locator":"045-046x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/999886289"}]},{"code":"AB00728MDS","anchor":"mds","translations":[{"language":"bi","lang_name":"Bislama"},{"language":"es","lang_name":"Spanish"},{"language":"am","lang_name":"Amharic"},{"language":"bs","lang_name":"Bosnian"},{"language":"ro","lang_name":"Romanian"},{"language":"uk","lang_name":"Ukrainian"},{"language":"no","lang_name":"Norwegian"},{"language":"kl","lang_name":"Kalaallisut"},{"language":"pt","lang_name":"Portuguese"},{"language":"ms","lang_name":"Malay"},{"language":"hu","lang_name":"Hungarian"},{"language":"pl","lang_name":"Polish"},{"language":"ca","lang_name":"Catalan"},{"language":"sl","lang_name":"Slovenian"},{"language":"en","l